      "time_updated": 1789818508765
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing the Provider**\n\nI'm focusing on selecting a speech-to-text service for the `submit_transcription.py` script. Google Cloud Speech-to-Text seems like a good fit, so I'm leaning toward that provider. The code needs to clearly identify and interact with this specific service.\n\n\n**Defining the Code**\n\nI'm now creating `submit_transcription.py`. It'll use Google Cloud Speech-to-Text. The Python code will leverage the client library to submit the audio. I'm focusing on incorporating the audio URI and configuration details into the transcription request and including comments to identify the provider.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818511401,
          "start": 1789818508765
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b97f15dd001QBCqyIz107WvuR",
      "message_id": "msg_0b97f0f6a001pGOlMRSZ2hnR9B",
      "session_id": "ses_f4680f117ffeggJ4JWVjQorIOj",
      "time_created": 1789818508765,
      "time_updated": 1789818511401
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "wGcteSwntuAF8aa5",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "\nfrom google.cloud import speech_v1p1beta1 as speech\n\ndef submit_transcription(gcs_uri: str):\n    \"\"\"Submits an audio file for batch transcription using Google Cloud Speech-to-Text.\"\"\"\n    # Google Cloud Speech-to-Text is the concrete external provider.\n    client = speech.SpeechClient()\n\n    audio = {\"uri\": gcs_uri}\n    config = {\n        \"encoding\": speech.RecognitionConfig.AudioEncoding.FLAC,  # Example encoding\n        \"sample_rate_hertz\": 16000,  # Example sample rate\n        \"language_code\": \"en-US\",\n        \"enable_automatic_punctuation\": True,\n    }\n\n    operation = client.long_running_recognize(config=config, audio=audio)\n\n    print(f\"Waiting for operation to complete...\\nOperation name: {operation.operation.name}\")\n    response = operation.result(timeout=90)  # Waits up to 90 seconds for operation to complete\n\n    for result in response.results:\n        print(f\"Transcript: {result.alternatives[0].transcript}\")\n        print(f\"Confidence: {result.alternatives[0].confidence}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    # Replace with your Google Cloud Storage URI for the audio file\n    # Example: \"gs://cloud-samples-data/speech/brooklyn_bridge.flac\"\n    audio_file_gcs_uri = \"gs://your-bucket-name/your-audio-file.flac\"  # <<< IMPORTANT: Update this line\n    submit_transcription(audio_file_gcs_uri)\n",
            "filePath": "submit_transcription.py"
          },
